{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "4a3b2ea342893de7b84c616f7bbbe32f7db159c5691fbe3182be80fca2ce2398", "ja": "大きなチャンス", "zh": "大好机会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "26cda089e8c3c62ec0aa911d65678523a33fff1ca34e93d74c0e7e0482b6223a", "ja": "『ルナ』の曲が完成し、レッスンスタート。\n今までの天体公演や『ソル』にも負けないよ\nうにとアイドル達がやる気を漲らせる中で、\n4人に公演前のミニライブ出演のオファーが\n舞い込み、前哨戦だと意気込む。", "zh": "《Luna》的歌曲完成，课程开始。\n偶像们为了不输给至今为止的天体公演和《Sol》，\n干劲十足之际，收到了为4人安排公演前迷你演出的邀约，\n大家都把这当作前哨战，斗志昂扬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e7e5e969f0e538872d3ffd98b3e34efd8ab609cf3cdc008bb68287b068c173cb", "ja": "（『ルナ』の曲が完成し、レッスンが始まっている。\n最初から立ち会っているが、すごい完成度だ！）", "zh": "（《月神》的歌曲完成了，练习也开始了。虽然从一开始我就一直在旁边观看，但完成度真高啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "173d20ae0f1a8657c9d876e3cca4139aff9dbaacf157dfdd59696dbc2c28d5e2", "ja": "そう、しっかり体でリズム取って！\nポイント外さないように！", "zh": "对，身体要好好跟上节奏！\n可别漏掉要点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "46f03a1e41e0c84ac0c2d0a82f0469fdc68920d2514d488b29fdbe198b5b7d47", "ja": "いくぞ千早！　一緒にターン！", "zh": "上吧，千早！一起转身！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "7c5841ac7d108c38427e970d5d18bf000fcbd6804458ad9b43a40e1adae11dd0", "ja": "うん、バッチリ！　そろそろ時間だから、\n今日はここまでにしよう！", "zh": "嗯，非常完美！差不多到时间了，今天就练到这里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "e7381a6fb96995dbcc27fac83cb99d5b792e9450deef2e83d687bd6cb53d9c66", "ja": "あ、もうそんな時間……。\nレッスンをしていると、あっという間ですね。", "zh": "啊，已经到这个时间了……。\n练习的时候，时间总是转眼就过去了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "d6fdce84a48169ae9477958ef8fed8d1f627fc71f02dfb335a42f50c53a57d02", "ja": "ふふっ、私はついていくのが大変で、長く感じたけれど\n……でも、かなり形になってきたんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，我为了跟上进度可费了不少劲，感觉时间过得挺久的……\n不过，应该已经练得相当有模有样了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "0d6f0afecbc909b0990e029c00ac28e81500d7eb1e4eacf7032fd8badc14ba61", "ja": "そうですね。\nでも、もっと上げられる気がするな～。", "zh": "是啊。\n不过，我觉得还能再提升一些呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "d51167edbac50aeab151446e6e43a7f5c514a543c9590f766e51be01555631fa", "ja": "もちろんだぞっ。\n自分たちなら、もっと上を目指せるさー！", "zh": "当然啦。\n凭我们自己的力量，还能向更高的目标前进啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "3d7c4174385ab4aea0cebf1150fa6cf3d45302935ceb6347c369ea3ffc8ee236", "ja": "そうね。今回の曲の力強さに、\n私たちもしっかり応えなくては。", "zh": "是啊。我们也必须充分回应这首歌这次展现出的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "4b1dd500f3fcca034b56c00eae2d73f3383998cc70a77bbed2872a7c9c8f5906", "ja": "曲もいいけど、千早の歌もやっぱりすごいね！\n心の奥まで響いてくるって感じでさ～。", "zh": "曲子固然好，但千早的歌声也真的太厉害了！感觉能直达心底呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "005d1615b399b6e8148918a509cfea351075a962d23b0026c4cdc92d3bf0f5de", "ja": "……ありがとう。\nでも、真も、みんなも流石だと思う。", "zh": "……谢谢。\n不过，真也好，大家也好，都很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "56505c2e42b6e7f7526097dd806a4461a9b98e18d5b4c459a49caefbfe296c07", "ja": "へへっ！　ボクだってやる気満々だからね！\n曲をもらってすぐ練習しまくったりして♪", "zh": "嘿嘿！我也是干劲十足的嘛！\n拿到歌曲后就马上拼命练习了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "7940881202658e5c6ca0a9de13d4c69a1b29ab954599ab2489237d9fcfa9d6da", "ja": "あら、真ちゃんの歌、勢いがあると思ったら……\nしっかり歌いこんでいたのね♪", "zh": "哎呀，我说真唱得这么有气势呢……\n原来是有好好练过呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "0d22a32d3c8b7bd6a549fb822853a7d02365fd3efcafa0a8e6421e8fe6464888", "ja": "でも、あずささんの歌も、\nいつも以上に情熱的だったような……。", "zh": "不过，梓小姐的歌声似乎也比平时更加热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "a36102ae950b1019a1509547632231dc51b86fc16874b9c920122d6553154b15", "ja": "自分も聞いててドキッとしたぞ。\n大人の本気の歌声って感じだったよね！", "zh": "我听着也心里一惊。很有大人认真唱歌的感觉，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "8350021edbb34c3e3d831823f75bb6dc817451ee8a1971365b46830a5224277f", "ja": "まぁ、ありがとう♪　確かに私も張りきっては\nいるのかも……。でも、うれしいわ。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢♪　我确实可能也是干劲\n十足呢……不过，我很高兴哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5392de7019c217175afe25ab3741fc1243688a51179feecc27e3538b335e5b53", "ja": "実際、4人ともかなりの完成度だと思います。\nもうここまで仕上げてくるなんて、驚いたな。", "zh": "实际上，我觉得4个人的完成度都相当高了。\n竟然已经磨合到了这个地步，真让人吃惊啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "98efd734d331da7bd4f49c986f21f870307c66a5404988e9ff3c6444e4ca1dc2", "ja": "へへっ、なんてったって今回は、\n『765PRO ALLSTARS』の天体公演ですからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，毕竟这次可是“765PRO ALLSTARS”的天体公演嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "0e234038a4dacfd266a48293aa500718f7cc99d6f21c2a206f6e26704769a881", "ja": "ボクたちも天体公演ができるっていうのがすっごく\n嬉しいし、そのぶん、頑張らないとって思うんです！", "zh": "我们也能举办天体公演，真的特别\n开心，也觉得正因如此必须更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "bc60870a54877c7ba2c568858d294a55721284da4bcef38bf0f5655082586515", "ja": "うんうん！　『ソル』の時も、亜美たちが真面目に\n頑張ってたぐらいだしね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！就连在《ソル》的时候，亚美她们都那么认真努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "e659f74061cb24c82146528d1ce55558759cbd3db12bf06da2d0352797382112", "ja": "そうね。嬉しいから、頑張りたい……。\n私もわかる気がする。", "zh": "是啊。因为开心，所以想努力……我好像也能理解这种心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "90a2c09b9dca860de276f8d88f4c714e4e71e90dbd3a22d4dd557453ad2fb05f", "ja": "ふふっ、嬉しい気持ちで頑張って、\nみんなにしっかり続いていきましょうね♪", "zh": "呵呵，让我们怀着喜悦的心情努力，\n好好地延续下去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "4ad39039def522546fb83345c2725030af817e0df20c7da524febd8b394368ec", "ja": "はい！　そして、今までのどんな星にも負けないくらい\n強く輝きましょう！", "zh": "好！然后，让我们绽放出不输给以往任何星辰的耀眼光芒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3516ff163380f8ae1d186a65b6c45c787bcb7404874fd7825e46deefbe67f3a7", "ja": "おお、頼もしい……！　今の仕上がり具合と\nその意気なら、全然問題なさそうだな。", "zh": "哦，真是可靠……！照现在的完成度和这股干劲来看，完全不用担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3dd518f8c426131917fa237a06dcda3fc2e9b9bc24f2511d5ea67ec70f526a33", "ja": "実は、そんなみんなの気合いをぶつけられる、\nいい舞台を用意したんだ。", "zh": "其实，我为你们准备了一个好舞台，\n能让大家尽情释放这份干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "a29363748bc8f57d5d49f89b61927db31c7ca3b8f85f5f0572aa94c6ddcc52b0", "ja": "え、いい舞台……？", "zh": "诶，好的舞台……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9bbd1794517123dda6582590bf60341b449874028f01793e94f9d89aed725211", "ja": "ああ。商業施設の特設ステージでのミニライブに、\n『ルナ』も出演させてもらえることになった！", "zh": "是啊。『露娜』也有机会参加商业设施特别舞台上的迷你演唱会了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "a503dc36e8c366354c51b9976f8356751db86ee1b2c8ddd391e797e0212130ce", "ja": "おおっ！？", "zh": "哦哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "6c731cdc560642a18942e5788c1ad757b081d289c1a8e1101bb5cb5ab4a04a87", "ja": "あ……！", "zh": "啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "35b6f544479743b55fb3fa721ceed98793246f9f9e0c29545045350b7ab865fb", "ja": "まぁ！", "zh": "哎呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "4e36c7351cf89f73ba3e9262441a2066221c26de40b3430f1045e18f8876a936", "ja": "ライブ……！\nでは、すぐ歌えるんですね？", "zh": "演出……！\n也就是说，马上就能唱了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "f38a91f06ba5327ddb2e72287247ea7f04c03f54ef36e1210912dde035b16628", "ja": "やーりぃ！\nそういうの、待ってました！", "zh": "太好啦！我等的就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "3ac8721b0a28fbf9b0d1ab19aa74e0f1e86e80e0823c7cbf71ca76120ceb4d46", "ja": "自分も、早くステージで歌いたいって思ってたところな\nんだ！　ありがとね、{$P$}！", "zh": "我也正想着要赶紧在舞台上唱歌来着！谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "4a04df49491339a62cb5362175dee2236700f3ada7b7515e79be9c33a4188410", "ja": "みんなにとっては小さな箱だけど、\n公演前にステージを披露する貴重な機会になると思う。", "zh": "对大家来说虽然只是个小场地，但我觉得这是一次在公演前登台演出的宝贵机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "24b72bda82f7144f931482250f5025723da913ebdb4cd94770c1c55ae01f456d", "ja": "天体公演に向けた前哨戦ライブだと思って、\n臨んでもらいたい。", "zh": "希望你们能把它当作天体公演的前哨战演出，\n全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1036_002chi", "source_sha256": "29bcb1bf82b2f7498fd4fbea398032d40459cdb6abe03cfb0051dd4d0de483af", "ja": "わかりました。まずはミニライブで、\n最高のパフォーマンスを。", "zh": "明白了。首先在迷你演唱会上，拿出最棒的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
