{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "e0eb5448118639a5d1a26514d6c70fdfb995160ace0b5d8aa3207a3111aee071", "ja": "うん！　『ソル』にも『BlueMoon Harmony』\nにも、絶対負けないステージにしてみせるさー！", "zh": "嗯！我一定会让这场演出成为不输给《Sol》和《BlueMoon Harmony》的舞台——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "581d689c3ec2b72c4b3df7ddd87dd218df10fae1aed780bc5c5ed56a5720d360", "ja": "そのためにも、やっぱりもう一段、\n上げていかないとね！", "zh": "为此，果然还得再提升一个层次才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0337_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_02_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "57b80bbc6663b7f57b2225a0c7f4cf4b4044323f683d161555cff781f9cff1ee", "ja": "響とボクはダンスを、千早とあずささんは歌を。\nそれぞれ、もっともっと高めていこう！", "zh": "响和我练舞，千早和梓小姐练歌。我们各自都要再更加努力地提升自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
